WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:05.338
I will kill the Mask!

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:07.966
Big brother,

00:00:08.758 --> 00:00:09.634
help me!

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:11.177
I'm on the roof of a building.

00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:13.221
There's a strange man with a mask on.

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:14.347
The Mask is there?

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:19.894
I won't die without seeing my big brother!

00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:23.106
That's the rule of this world. Accept it.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:26.901
The Mask's aim is to drive people
to suicide from despair.

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:29.696
Is there really a human being
inside the Mask?

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:32.407
May I speak to you?

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.035
This realm is an institution
that creates Gods.

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:38.163
What on earth?
What is "Become a God"?

00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:41.791
My name is Kazuma Aohara.

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:46.713
Could I say that
I am God Candidate within this realm?

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:48.923
I cannot defy the Mask's orders.

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:54.512
Do you know how to access
the Railgun System?

00:00:56.931 --> 00:00:58.933
I want to bring true peace to the world.

00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:02.187
If you behave disrespectfully,
you will have to die.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:04.647
I dare you to do it, you fiend!

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.399
I want to die with you!

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:07.859
Mayuko!

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:10.070
You better not direct
your hostility at me.

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:11.196
I'll become God.

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:13.364
I am right about everything!

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:15.700
Anything that they desire.

00:01:15.784 --> 00:01:17.660
I will wipe them out, no matter what!

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.204
I am going to die.

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:20.955
Die?

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:22.957
I will not die!

